 certainly no stranger to organised protest. On 9 September 1998, United of=
ficially confirmed to the London Stock Exchange that the board had accepted=
 a =C2=A3623.4m takeover bid from Rupert Murdoch=E2=80=99s giant, BSkyB. Th=
e announcement triggered an immediate outcry and supporters travelled to Ol=
